  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 14 × 4 ÷ 10 + 10 – 20 = 2\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 2, 10\n\nGiven: 14 × 4 ÷ 10 + 10 – 20 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers, we get.\n\n⇒ 14 ×__** 4 ÷ 2**__ + 2 - 20 = 10\n\n⇒ __**14 × 2**__ + 2 - 20 = 10\n\n⇒ __**28 + 2**__ - 20 = 10\n\n⇒__ **30 - 20** __= 10\n\n⇒**10 = 10**\n\nOption 2) 2, 14\n\nGiven: 14 × 4 ÷ 10 + 10 – 20 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers, we get.\n\n⇒ 2 ×__** 4 ÷ 10**__ + 10 – 20 = 14\n\n⇒ __**2 **____**× 0.4**__ + 10 - 20 = 14\n\n⇒ __**0.8 + 10**__ - 20 = 14\n\n⇒ __**10.8 -20**__ = 14\n\n⇒ 9.2 ≠ 14.\n\nOption 3) 10, 20 \n\nGiven: 14 × 4 ÷ 10 + 10 – 20 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers, we get.\n\n⇒ 14 × __**4 ÷ 20**__ + 20 - 20 = 2\n\n⇒ __**14 × 0.5 **__+ 20 - 20 = 2\n\n⇒ __**7 + 20 **__- 20 = 2\n\n⇒ __**27 - 20**__ = 2\n\n⇒ 7 ≠ 2\n\nOption 4) 4, 20\n\nGiven: 14 × 4 ÷ 10 + 10 – 20 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers, we get.\n\n⇒ 14 × __**20 ÷ 10**__ + 10 – 4 = 2\n\n⇒ __**14 × 2 **__+ 10 - 4 = 2\n\n⇒__** 28 + 10**__ - 4 = 2\n\n⇒ __**28 - 4 **__= 2\n\n⇒ 24 ≠ 2\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\".**",
